# Engine code

- Event clock: `disclosure_date`. Tests in `tests/test_lookahead.py` stay green.
- Ingest: reject bad rows; never silent-default amount bands.
- New behavior needs a test next to the existing suite (`pytest`).
- No ML, no AWS, unless the ticket is CA-009/CA-010 and unblocked.
